  "description": "So, you want to get a little more serious yeah? The Tract 2 is for those who want to spend some serious time exploring, designed for those who crave excitement and demand peak performance.\nEngineered from rugged 6061 alloy, the Tract 2 laughs in the face of challenging terrains. It’s not merely a bike; it’s your compadre, ready for epic adventures on any trail. Feel the thrill with a Suntour coil fork with 100mm of travel and adjustable damping – your secret weapon for turning every path into a dynamic playground. Turn heads effortlessly with wide alloy handlebar, 50mm stem, and a semi-integrated headset, providing not just control but an injection of style into your trail conquests.\nGrip, rip, and slide like a boss with double walled rims, 2.3” trail-ready tires, and Tektro hydraulic disc brakes for immense stopping power. Seamless shifts are at your fingertips thanks to Shimano’s brand-new Cues U6000 groupset with clutch derailleur, matched to a precision-engineered narrow wide crankset with oversized axle and external bottom bracket. Chain drop and slap are a thing of the past. This is ten speeds of pure pleasure! Finishing kit is handpicked by Reid to compliment and complete the build, lock on grips, trail ready saddle, and lightweight alloy seatpost.\nThe Tract 2 is an open invitation to unleash your wild side, conquer uncharted territories, and turn every ride into a celebration of pure radness. Time to make everything of your off-road experience!",
